    {"id":"oldtext","type":"text","x":65,"y":140,"width":700,"height":830,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#172033","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a4","roundness":null,"seed":15,"version":1,"versionNonce":115,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1788048000000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"BEFORE — one shared iter_num=2\n\nLEFT INPUT score [bsz][G*N]\n[b0g0:2][b0g1:2][b1g0:2][b1g1:2][tail]\n\nRIGHT INPUT V [bsz][C][kv_cols]\nb0: 2 live rows × 4 features; 2 capacity rows\nb1: 2 live rows × 4 features; 2 capacity rows\n\nEACH CONTRACTION\nscore[1×2] @ V[2×4] -> output[1×4]\n\nOUTPUT [bsz][G][kv_cols]\n[b0g0:4][b0g1:4][b1g0:4][b1g1:4]\n\nDSD WALK\nbind score once, length N; bind output once\nfor b, for g:\n  reset V base; @map(N)\n  increment score by N; output by kv_cols\n\nV reset is required: @map advances through V rows.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"BEFORE — one shared iter_num=2\n\nLEFT INPUT score [bsz][G*N]\n[b0g0:2][b0g1:2][b1g0:2][b1g1:2][tail]\n\nRIGHT INPUT V [bsz][C][kv_cols]\nb0: 2 live rows × 4 features; 2 capacity rows\nb1: 2 live rows × 4 features; 2 capacity rows\n\nEACH CONTRACTION\nscore[1×2] @ V[2×4] -> output[1×4]\n\nOUTPUT [bsz][G][kv_cols]\n[b0g0:4][b0g1:4][b1g0:4][b1g1:4]\n\nDSD WALK\nbind score once, length N; bind output once\nfor b, for g:\n  reset V base; @map(N)\n  increment score by N; output by kv_cols\n\nV reset is required: @map advances through V rows.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"newtext","type":"text","x":860,"y":140,"width":700,"height":835,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#172033","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a5","roundness":null,"seed":16,"version":2,"versionNonce":216,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1788134400000,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"AFTER — request lengths [1,3]\n\nLEFT INPUT score [bsz][request segment G*C]\nrequest0 [g0:1][g1:1][tail:6]\nrequest1 [g0:3][g1:3][tail:2]\n\nRIGHT INPUT V storage order unchanged\nb0: 1 live row × 4 features; 3 capacity rows\nb1: 3 live rows × 4 features; 1 capacity row\n\nCONTRACTIONS\nb0: score[1×1] @ V[1×4]\nb1: score[1×3] @ V[3×4]\n\nOUTPUT [bsz][G][kv_cols]: unchanged fixed slots\n\nIMPLEMENTED DSD WALK\nfor b: derive L; if L>0 bind score/output once\n  for g: reset V base; @map(L)\n    increment score by L; output by kv_cols\n\nThe V base reset remains. Invariant right/output\nDSD lengths are set only outside the group loop.\nRuntime impact remains unknown.","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"AFTER — request lengths [1,3]\n\nLEFT INPUT score [bsz][request segment G*C]\nrequest0 [g0:1][g1:1][tail:6]\nrequest1 [g0:3][g1:3][tail:2]\n\nRIGHT INPUT V storage order unchanged\nb0: 1 live row × 4 features; 3 capacity rows\nb1: 3 live rows × 4 features; 1 capacity row\n\nCONTRACTIONS\nb0: score[1×1] @ V[1×4]\nb1: score[1×3] @ V[3×4]\n\nOUTPUT [bsz][G][kv_cols]: unchanged fixed slots\n\nIMPLEMENTED DSD WALK\nfor b: derive L; if L>0 bind score/output once\n  for g: reset V base; @map(L)\n    increment score by L; output by kv_cols\n\nThe V base reset remains. Invariant right/output\nDSD lengths are set only outside the group loop.\nRuntime impact remains unknown.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},
